# GearVR framework exporter

A Blender addon to export scene components from Blender to a GVRf application
that provides a JavaScript interface, similar to Remote Scriptint demo.

## How to install

Copy the gvr-exporter directory to Blender's addon directory

## How to use

Run the gvr-remove-scripting client application on a device.

In the *\_\_init.py\_\_* file change the *\_ip* address to reflect the client's device IP.

Enable the gvr-exporter addon on Blender through user preferences menu.

Press space bar to open the search menu, look for the gvrf addon, and click on "Export Scene to GVRf".